.TH QSM-PVE-DIRECT-SIGNAL 8 "2026-10-20" "QSM Direct" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
qsm-pve-direct-signal \- Run PVE-authorized HTTPS signalling
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qsm-pve-direct-signal
.SH DESCRIPTION
This daemon authenticates console requests using Proxmox VE tickets. Configure its endpoint with qsm-pve-direct-endpoint and manage it with qsm-pve-direct-signal.service.
.SH DOCUMENTATION
See /usr/share/doc/qsm-pve-direct/README.Debian and
.UR https://github.com/rdmitry0911/qsm-rd
the project repository
.UE .
